OL,3,GNEWSAFormer pub to be converted into
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former pub in Scarborough is to be
OL,7,Fconverted into residential flats after
OL,8,Fplans were approved by North Yorkshire
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FSix flats currently exist on the first
OL,12,Fand second floors of the former Durham
OL,13,FHotel pub at 44-46 North Marine Road.
OL,15,FSubmitted plans stated that the change
OL,16,Fof use for the building would provide
OL,17,Fmuch-needed accommodation in the centre
OL,18,Fof Scarborough and would not harm the
OL,19,Fconservation area as no external
OL,20,Falterations were proposed to the front
OL,21,Fof the property.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
