OL,3,GNEWSAFormer pub to be converted into
OL,4,Aflats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals, which were approved by
OL,7,Fthe authority on 20 August, stated that
OL,8,Fthe public house had been closed for
OL,9,Fmore than four years and had remained
OL,10,Fvacant throughout that period.
